# BuildKit reads <Containerfile>.dockerignore beside the Containerfile, whatever
# the build context. Working state and anything that may hold a secret stay out
# of a published configuration, at any depth: a pattern without **/ matches at
# the root of the context only.
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/.envrc.local
**/.DS_Store
# The examples image takes the repository root as its context.
.git
.github
.claude
.mcp.json
